. Always verify by actually running the test/command yourself, never trust the plan's characterization blindly.\n- `unsafe_code = \"forbid\"` workspace invariant — never introduce unsafe blocks.\n- Run `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph` and `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` before committing; this repo's pre-commit hook enforces format-check and WILL reject an unformatted commit — if that happens, run `cargo fmt`, re-stage, and create a fresh commit (do not amend).\n- Watch for `clippy::cmp_owned` specifically if your test compares a `PathBuf` — use `Path::new(\"...\")` on the right-hand side of `==` against a `PathBuf`/`&Path`, not `PathBuf::from(\"...\")`. This lint has bitten prior tasks already.\n- Commit per task once green, using the plan's commit_message (or a corrected one if it doesn't match what was actually implemented) — established, user-approved pattern for this pipeline.\n\nReport back: task_id, status, steps_completed, test_result, commit_sha, criteria_evidence (file+line for test and implementation per criterion in covers_criteria), and any concerns/contradictions found.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/5e79b5c6-5688-4728-8d81-ff2c106a0e2e/tasks/a7a7fc331bfeafd71.output","canReadOutputFile":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"376f5608-94ad-41d5-ba8d-5748e47a90a2","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.232","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
