{"parentUuid":"7b5e6245-cc5f-4e4b-b44b-a562fce16317","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"16","subject":"Track 3a/3b1/3b2: Workspace-membership (done) + identity-promotion core (redrafting) + downstream consumers (pending)","description":"Track 3a: spec DONE (34 criteria after amendment fixing npm hybrid-root gap found during planning), plan being amended for 4 new criteria. Track 3b1: spec DONE (27 criteria), plan DONE (22 tasks, already challenger-reviewed). Track 3b2: spec DONE (19 criteria), plan not yet drafted (has hard implementation-ordering dependency on 3b1's code landing first, so lower urgency). Next: finish 3a's plan amendment, then lambda-recon + lambda-implementer for 3a and 3b1.","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 3b-e","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"17","subject":"Track 1: Fixed-group version engine correctness (Phase 1, full pipeline, depends on Track 3)","description":"3 fixes: cascade.rs bump_target delegate to fixed_group_target (CascadeInput needs tags field, 3 construction sites), wire pre_mutation_checks into version command orchestration, ConflictingGroupMembership detection in GroupTable::resolve. Files: groups.rs, config/groups.rs, cascade.rs, commands/{version,snapshot}.rs.","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 1","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"18","subject":"Track 9: Cascade correctness - peer-escalation & rewrite keys (Phase 1, lighter TDD, sequenced with Track 1)","description":"2 fixes in cascade.rs: peer-escalation ignores true source severity (unused _source param), rewrite keys use PackageId::name() instead of IdentityIndex::native_name (crashes version on cross-ecosystem edges). No open decision.","activeForm":"Fixing Track 9 cascade correctness","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"19","subject":"Track 2: Platform-manifest / optionalDependencies writes (Phase 1, full pipeline, gated on Decision 5, depends on Track 1a)","description":"Nothing populates VersionPlan.platform_writes/optional_dep_updates - needs planning logic built from scratch, not just consumption loops. Must integrate with Spec A/B write-batching safety invariants. canon-drafter to evaluate Spec-A/B-style split. BLOCKED until Decision 5 scope question is resolved and Track 1a ships.","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 2","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"20","subject":"Track 4: Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness (Phase 2, full pipeline, gated on Decision 3, sequenced with Track 6)","description":"status --check exit-code contract inverted vs action.yml (release-PR path unreachable); clap exit-code 2 collides with no-changesets branch; callisto tag fabricates sha on mismatch; plan_publish never reads CHANGELOG.md back. Spans callisto-model, callisto-graph, and .github/actions/callisto-action/action.yml. BLOCKED on Decision 3 (JSON wire-format versioning).","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 4","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"21","subject":"Track 6-mechanical: JSON report-contract alignment (Phase 2, lighter TDD, gated on Decision 3)","description":"StatusReport/StatusPackageRecord/SnapshotReport/ComposePrBodyReport/CreatedTag/InitReport/ValidateReport field-shape mismatches. One report type at a time, never batched. BLOCKED on Decision 3 (JSON wire-format versioning), coordinate with Track 4.","activeForm":"Fixing Track 6 JSON report contracts","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"22","subject":"Track 6-doc: Fix atomic_write / \"no I/O\" stale spec claim (docs/01-spec.md §M.1.2, no pipeline needed)","description":"callisto-model documented as \"no I/O\" but atomic_write moved there deliberately. Real invariant is license permissiveness, not no-I/O. Doc-only fix, ready to do immediately.","activeForm":"Fixing atomic_write doc claim","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"23","subject":"Track 5: Changelog/PR-body rendering consolidation (Phase 3, full pipeline, depends on Track 1b)","description":"pr_body.rs bypasses render_section; ChangeSource::Commit and ChangeSource::NewGroupMember never constructed; ChangelogInput.entries doesn't union multiple causes. BLOCKED until Track 1b (pre_mutation_checks wiring) ships since NewGroupMember has no producer until then.","activeForm":"Drafting canon spec for Track 5","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"24","subject":"Track 7: Performance - git revwalk bounding & redundant I/O (Phase 4, lighter TDD, parallelizable)","description":"commits_since_with_pathspec unbounded double revwalk (~2s vs ~13ms at scale, plus wrong changedSinceLastTag answer riding along); TagIndex::build per-package glob recompilation; workspace-root Cargo.toml re-read 3x; npm/cargo manifest re-read redundancy; inference pathspec targets manifest file not package dir. One finding at a time. Excludes the already-known deferred Cargo workspace-inherited dep rewrite batching gap.","activeForm":"Fixing Track 7 performance findings","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"25","subject":"Track 8-mechanical: ConfigError variants + Python workspace-root detection (Phase 4, lighter TDD)","description":"ConfigError::OverlappingPackageSets/PackageMatchedNothing never constructed; is_workspace_root has no Python-aware marker despite pyproject.toml being default-on.","activeForm":"Fixing Track 8 mechanical items","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"26","subject":"Track 8-doc: Fix Python \"demand-gated\" stale spec claim (no pipeline needed)","description":"Spec claims Python is demand-gated/not-implemented; real code is a complete 1681-line default-on implementation with 50+ tests. Fix the spec claim, not the code.","activeForm":"Fixing Python demand-gated doc claim","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"27","subject":"Track 11/12: Diagnostic/error-contract polish + remaining doc-only fixes (Phase 4, lighter TDD, queued serially)","description":"Missing #[diagnostic] attrs on ParseChangeset, inconsistent error-code coverage, stale spec Cargo.toml diagrams, wrong section citations. Low severity, batch-friendly but still one fix per commit.","activeForm":"Fixing diagnostic/doc polish items","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"28","subject":"DECISIONS: Resolve 5 open product/architecture decisions gating Tracks 2/3a/4/6/8-feature","description":"1) [[package]]/[[package-set]] match: name vs path semantics (blocks Track 3a). 2) moon.yml extensions.callisto: build or cut (blocks Track 8-feature). 3) JSON wire-format breaking change: schemaVersion bump strategy (blocks Track 4+6). 4) inference feature default-on status (cross-cutting). 5) Track 2 scope: single track or Spec-A/B-style split (blocks Track 2). Ask user before drafting specs for gated tracks. See /Users/gabe/.claude/plans/shimmying-giggling-hickey.md for full detail.","activeForm":"Awaiting decisions from user","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"29","subject":"Track 10 (Phase 5, deferred): Test/fixture infrastructure buildout - explicit scoping conversation needed","description":"callisto-fixtures missing GraphBuilder/ScenarioBuilder/ReplayCommandRunner/data corpus; several crates lack wasm32-wasip1 CI. Large, additive, no production-correctness impact. Matches SESSION_HANDOFF.md precedent: name it, don't schedule it. NOT started - needs its own future scoping conversation with user before any work begins.","activeForm":"Deferred - awaiting scoping conversation","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":14},"type":"attachment","uuid":"923cd966-3f3b-42c1-87f9-e92ef9be05ad","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:17:21.591Z","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.232","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-gig