all-targets -- -D warnings` are clean.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-29\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"confirmed 24 prior commits present on ignore_walk.rs and clean tree\",\n    \"read AC-11d exact criterion text from spec file on disk\",\n    \"wrote test covering all three zero-document input shapes (empty/whitespace/comments)\",\n    \"ran test — passed immediately (no red step, as expected for regression-proof task)\",\n    \"adversarially broke docs.first()? -&gt; docs[0] in membership.rs, confirmed test panics\",\n    \"restored membership.rs to original safe form, confirmed diff clean\",\n    \"ran full callisto-graph lib test suite (309 passed)\",\n    \"ran cargo fmt and cargo clippy -D warnings (clean)\",\n    \"committed\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"d4dd8cc\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-11d\",\n      \"test_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 1709,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 276\n    }\n  ],\n  \"concerns\": \"Plan's failing_test stub only covered the comments-only variant; test was expanded to cover all three zero-document shapes named in AC-11d's exact spec text (empty, whitespace-only, comments-only) per the task instruction to reconcile plan vs spec.\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"No implementation change needed; docs.first()? in membership.rs:276 already guards this case correctly, confirmed via mutation-style adversarial check.\"\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>53518</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>19</tool_uses><duration_ms>345078</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"0184b5e0-a9b1-4fdb-903e-5da725d165f8","timestamp":"2026-08-16T03:11:36.696Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType"