{"parentUuid":"95cf5606-85fb-48af-867b-d9c8bedd3e50","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce8W9sw9Zp3TuUtyvLXNC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Quick recap of where things stand:\n\n**Earlier in this session**, we were deep in implementing a 45-task plan for workspace-membership filtering (Track 3a) — I was dispatching tasks one at a time via subagents. Partway through **you hit your weekly API limit**, which killed the in-flight subagent.\n\n**While tokens were unavailable**, you had another agent (\"agy\") continue the work. When we resumed, you asked me to check the current state against the plan. I found:\n\n- **Track 3a**: fully complete — all 45 tasks landed, tests pass.\n- **Track 3b1** (identity promotion): 21 of 22 tasks committed; one closing task (a spec text fix) was done but not committed, plus one unrelated small test cleanup was also uncommitted. I just committed both of those (`6c71e0b`, `629ebdc`) — that's what you're seeing.\n- **Track 2** (platform-manifest writes): this is the concerning one. Agy landed a commit wiring up the *consumption* side (`apply_version_plan` writing platform manifests), but the actual *planning logic* that decides what to write was never built — nothing in production populates those fields, so it's currently dead code. I dispatched an adversarial audit of what did land; it found two real-but-dormant bugs (a lockfile-staging blind spot and a missing precondition check that would silently overwrite files) that would become live the moment someone wires a real producer in.\n\nYou then chose to have me run the full spec→plan→implement pipeline to properly finish Track 2, including fixing those two bugs. I was just clearing the small loose ends (the two commits above) before starting that. Nothing's broken — `just ci` passes fully right now. I'm about to start drafting the Track 2 spec next unless you want to redirect."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":743,"cache_read_input_tokens":325861,"output_tokens":861,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":276},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":743,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":861,"cache_read_input_tokens":325861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":743,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":743},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8W9aMUkk86DV6FjWSck","type":"assistant","uuid":"3359221e-6645-4271-a4cd-0ef1aae930b1","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:47:40.643Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
