{"parentUuid":"be40bfca-931d-49f7-84fe-62490c805957","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce8WEs1UiAnL9nYWHA3j1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before drafting the Track 2 spec, I found a real blocker: the master plan explicitly said Track 2 depends on Track 1(a) (fixed-group cascade target correctness), and Track 1 was never actually done either. I just confirmed this directly — `cascade.rs`'s `raise()` still calls `bump_target(pkg, sev, input)`, which bumps each fixed-group sibling independently from its own base version, never delegating to `fixed_group_target` for a group-aligned target. That's the exact bug Track 1(a) was meant to fix, still live in the current cascade path.\n\nIf I draft Track 2's spec now, its platform-manifest-write planning logic would have to source a version target from this same buggy per-sibling computation — baking the divergence bug into platform manifests too, which is precisely what the master plan warned against."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1512,"cache_read_input_tokens":332453,"output_tokens":1426,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":665},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1512,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1426,"cache_read_input_tokens":332453,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1512,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1512},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8WEn74BtxF2V6Lm8MJm","type":"assistant","uuid":"5e65caca-8c23-4992-a17b-88aa399db5bb","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:48:44.906Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/U