{"parentUuid":"a92deb59-f088-431f-b4b2-a38a4ee685ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce8dFVq78oYn1L3mFNySw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The re-verification surfaced a real tension worth weighing carefully rather than plowing past: three criteria (AC-004, AC-007b, AC-010c) trace their origin to gaps the *audit* and *exit-gate* found, not to the original requirement text — and AC-010c's dedup requirement arguably brushes against the requirement's own scope boundary (\"GroupTable::resolve's other responsibilities... out of scope\"). This is legitimate audit-driven completeness (closing real correctness gaps: without dedup, double-counted members would corrupt the very divergence/target logic this spec is fixing), not scope creep for its own sake — but I'll let the audit step weigh it explicitly rather than deciding unilaterally."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4324,"cache_read_input_tokens":391409,"output_tokens":4289,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2897},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4324,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4289,"cache_read_input_tokens":391409,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4324,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4324},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8dFSipxWW3so2Bko7yV","type":"assistant","uuid":"831b5de7-5d29-4866-adf0-2445d1612981","timestamp":"2026-08-17T16:21:05.823Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"ma