itectural misdiagnosis by doing this, so do not skip it) — in particular confirm: (a) the new Fixed-group convergence block description in api_surface matches what solve_cascade's actual Linked-group block at cascade.rs:314-379 does structurally, (b) cascade.rs's test module really does have 7 pre-existing CascadeInput literals that would fail to compile without a tags field, (c) plan_snapshot really doesn't call ws.tags() anywhere today, (d) GroupCheckOutcome really has an unconsumed new_members field, (e) the non_goals/api_surface/scope text no longer contains any residual mention of dedup/.dedup() now that AC-010c is removed (check for orphaned references left behind by the edit).\n\nApply your standard adversarial pass/fail standard: every acceptance criterion must be a testable proposition with no vague language, no TBDs anywhere, error cases covered with is_error_case: true, scope narrow enough for one planning cycle. Default disposition is fail. Output a verdict@1 with artifact_type \"spec@1\"."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":513,"cache_read_input_tokens":421400,"output_tokens":1203,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":513,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1203,"cache_read_input_tokens":421400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":513,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":513},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8ek9pkd5UqsTt2gcvcu","type":"assistant","uuid":"c3634091-87ea-41ab-ab1a-54f0479efb9f","timestamp":"2026-08-17T16:40:20.022Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd