tection (no dedup — that was explicitly descoped).\n\nSequence tasks by dependency: the CascadeInput field addition and its 15 call-site updates must land before anything that depends on the field compiling; the new Fixed-group convergence block depends on the tags field; plan_version's pre_mutation_checks wiring can proceed somewhat independently of the cascade block but both are needed before the full AC-002 (real-call-path) criterion is provable; GroupTable::resolve's conflict detection is independent of the other two bugs and can be sequenced anywhere. No task should exceed 15 minutes for a competent developer — this will likely mean the CascadeInput field addition is split from the Fixed-group block addition, which is split from the plan_version wiring, which is split from the GroupTable::resolve fix, each further split into red-test/implementation task pairs as needed. Every acceptance criterion in the spec (16 total: AC-001 through AC-013 plus AC-007b, AC-010b, AC-014) must appear in at least one task's covers_criteria.\n\nOutput the plan@1 to your own returned object (the calling process will persist it to .claude/plans/ and pass it through vector-challenger before implementation begins)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1026,"cache_read_input_tokens":450358,"output_tokens":1143,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1026,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1143,"cache_read_input_tokens":450358,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1026,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1026},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8hXjT4W1o9z9HPenbZA","type":"assist