ch the exit-gate proved unreachable for the seed-path scenario); the corrected spec places the fix inside solve_cascade's `while changed` fixpoint loop as a new block, NOT in raise(). Do not touch raise()'s existing per-sibling loop (cascade.rs:464-478) — it is explicitly left unmodified per the spec's non_goals (its output is superseded by the new block on the next fixpoint pass, not removed).\n\nA separate task, T10, is running concurrently in another agent right now, scoped to crates/callisto-graph/src/config/groups.rs — do NOT touch that file, it's out of scope for you.\n\nStandard practices: `unsafe_code = \"forbid\"`. Run `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph` and `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` before committing. Run the full crate test suite (`cargo test -p callisto-graph`) to confirm no regressions. Commit once green.\n\nReport back: task_id, status, steps_completed, test_result, commit_sha (exact short SHA from `git log --oneline -1`), criteria_evidence (file+line for AC-001/AC-002/AC-004), concerns."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2211,"cache_read_input_tokens":477707,"output_tokens":2438,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":209},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2211,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2438,"cache_read_input_tokens":477707,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2211,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2211},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8tnoXLU6YtzPebcvcci","type":"assistant","uuid":"8d331ebf-32ab-4303-ac79-19d58716a973","timestamp":"2026-08-17T19:44:37.945Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType