 the full crate test suite (`cargo test -p callisto-graph`) to confirm no regressions. Commit once green.\n\nReport back: task_id, status, steps_completed, test_result, commit_sha (exact short SHA from `git log --oneline -1`), criteria_evidence (file+line for AC-001/AC-002/AC-004), concerns.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2/tasks/a21e86b514c63303d.output","canReadOutputFile":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8d331ebf-32ab-4303-ac79-19d58716a973","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
