{"parentUuid":"8479c475-dce1-4f32-aa4a-ba4bc61e0b69","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce8zXo8YzTTEMyETJzGkW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HrJk1gUrxgBPtqm8kWnb81","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\npython3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118/scratchpad/spec-track2-draft.json') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\nfor e in d['api_surface']:\n    print('---', e['name'], '---')\n    print(e['description'][:600])\n    print()\n\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2969,"cache_read_input_tokens":573242,"output_tokens":340,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":96},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2969,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":340,"cache_read_input_tokens":573242,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2969,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2969},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8zXjs6Ur7gZsoXVvWpu","type":"assistant","uuid":"3f90134e-9142-4e92-8360-ae4ff338b46f","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:59:38.546Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"3f90134e-9142-4e92-8360-ae4ff338b46f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a324e89f-0d64-49f6-9a03-6612dd5892ad","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HrJk1gUrxgBPtqm8kWnb81","type":"tool_result","content":"--- PlatformWrite ---\nAdds a `from: Version` field (previously only `manifest` and `version` existed, crates/callisto-graph/src/plan.rs lines 45-49) capturing the platform manifest's on-disk version as observed by plan_version at plan time. Consumed by apply_version_plan's platform_writes dispatch loop as the expected-current-version precondition, mirroring PlannedBump.from's role in the sibling bump loops. This is a breaking change to any code constructing PlatformWrite directly (existing test fixtures in apply.rs and any future snapshot/pr_body producer) -- all call sites must supply `from`.\n\n--- commands::version::plan_version ---\nSignature unchanged. Behavior changes: the returned VersionPlan.platform_writes and VersionPlan.optional_dep_updates are now populated per AC-001 through AC-011 instead of being hardcoded to Vec::new() (previously at commands/version.rs lines 262-263). Can now return a new error path (AC-011) when a Fixed group's platform manifest cannot be opened or read.\n\n--- apply::apply_version_plan ---\nSignature unchanged. Behavior changes: (1) active_ecosystems (apply.rs lines 325-349) is now also derived from plan.platform_writes and plan.optional_dep_updates manifest paths, affecting which lockfiles get refreshed/staged (AC-005, AC-006); (2) the platform_writes dispatch loop (apply.rs lines 244-252) gains a current-version precondition check against PlatformWrite.from before writing, returning GraphError::UnexpectedManifestVersion on mismatch instead of overwriting unconditionally (AC-007, AC-008).","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1d40a9f6-fd57-478e-a057-dbc5a8f8c365","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:59:41.131Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"--- PlatformWrite ---\nAdds a `from: Version` field (previously only `manifest` and `version` existed, crates/callisto-graph/src/plan.rs lines 45-49) capturing the platform manifest's on-disk version as observed by plan_version at plan time. Consumed by apply_version_plan's platform_writes dispatch loop as the expected-current-version precondition, mirroring PlannedBump.from's role in the sibling bump loops. This is a breaking change to any code constructing PlatformWrite directly (existing test fixtures in apply.rs and any future snapshot/pr_body producer) -- all call sites must supply `from`.\n\n--- commands::version::plan_version ---\nSignature unchanged. Behavior changes: the returned VersionPlan.platform_writes and VersionPlan.optional_dep_updates are now populated per AC-001 through AC-011 instead of being hardcoded to Vec::new() (previously at commands/version.rs lines 262-263). Can now return a new error path (AC-011) when a Fixed group's platform manifest cannot be opened or read.\n\n--- apply::apply_version_plan ---\nSignature unchanged. Behavior changes: (1) active_ecosystems (apply.rs lines 325-349) is now also derived from plan.platform_writes and plan.optional_dep_updates manifest paths, affecting which lockfiles get refreshed/staged (AC-005, AC-006); (2) the platform_writes dispatch loop (apply.rs lines 244-252) gains a current-version precondition check against PlatformWrite.from before writing, returning GraphError::UnexpectedManifestVersion on mismatch instead of overwriting unconditionally (AC-007, AC-008).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3f90134e-9142-4e92-8360-ae4ff338b46f","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
