{"parentUuid":"e6c08176-e1e7-4dbb-9f4a-fef77b4c99fa","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"58aed121-2a04-4d66-8c3f-434866c76e39","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>abb6a93150a9bf4bf</task-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2/tasks/abb6a93150a9bf4bf.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Mutation test Track 1 touched files\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>## Mutation Testing Report — Track 1 (Fixed-Group Cascade Correctness)\n\nI ran `cargo-mutants 27.1.0` scoped to the four implementation files via `-f` flags (package `callisto-graph`). Baseline build succeeded; 105 mutants were generated and tested.\n\n**Result: 41 caught, 28 clearly missed, 28 timed out (ambiguous), 7 unviable, 1 build success (non-mutant).** That's a 39% unambiguous survival rate against `cascade.rs`, `commands/version.rs`, `commands/snapshot.rs`, and `config/groups.rs` — far too high to pass. The root cause: `cascade_action`, `caret_covers`, and `coverage()` in `cascade.rs` have **zero direct unit tests** (only exercised indirectly through higher-level `solve_cascade` integration tests, which don't hit every branch), and `GroupTable::validate_syntactic` in `groups.rs` is called from `config/resolve.rs:365` but has no test anywhere that triggers any of its three error variants.\n\nFull outcome data: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/mutants.out/{missed.txt,timeout.txt,caught.txt,outcomes.json}`.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tool_used\": \"cargo-mutants\",\n  \"mutants_tested\": 105,\n  \"survived_mutants\": [\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:43:9\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":43,\"mutation_description\":\"delete match arm (Runtime|Optional|Build, Covers) in cascade_action\",\"why_it_survived\":\"no test asserts CascadeDecision for a Runtime/Optional/Build dep whose new version is covered by its spec\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:49:9\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":49,\"mutation_description\":\"delete match arm (Peer, Covers) in cascade_action\",\"why_it_survived\":\"no direct test of Peer+Covers\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:55:9\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":55,\"mutation_description\":\"delete match arm (Peer, DoesNotCover) [non-escalation] in cascade_action\",\"why_it_survived\":\"no test with peer_escalation=false and Peer/DoesNotCover\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:60:9\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":60,\"mutation_description\":\"delete match arm (Dev, _) in cascade_action\",\"why_it_survived\":\"no test of Dev dep kind at all\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:50:33\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":50,\"mutation_description\":\"replace guard cfg.peer_escalation &amp;&amp; matches!(coverage,DoesNotCover) with true\",\"why_it_survived\":\"peer_escalation=false path never asserted\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:50:53\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":50,\"mutation_description\":\"replace &amp;&amp; with || in peer-escalation guard\",\"why_it_survived\":\"same as above — only the true/true combo is exercised\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:65:55(true)\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":65,\"mutation_description\":\"replace guard s != Severity::None with true\",\"why_it_survived\":\"CASCADE_MODE governed_by override never checked against a None-severity case\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:65:55(false)\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":65,\"mutation_description\":\"replace guard s != Severity::None with false\",\"why_it_survived\":\"same — no assertion on governed_by for Always+Covers with non-None severity\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:65:57\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":65,\"mutation_description\":\"replace != with == in governed_by guard\",\"why_it_survived\":\"same gap\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:83:18\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":83,\"mutation_description\":\"replace == with != in coverage() DepSpec::Exact branch\",\"why_it_survived\":\"coverage() has no direct unit test for any DepSpec variant\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:126:16\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":126,\"mutation_description\":\"replace &gt; with &gt;= in caret_covers cmp.is_lt() guard\",\"why_it_survived\":\"no boundary test at new==cur\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:128:23(==)\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":128,\"mutation_description\":\"replace &gt; with == in caret_covers cur_maj&gt;0\",\"why_it_survived\":\"no cur_maj==0 vs &gt;0 boundary test\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:128:23(&lt;)\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":128,\"mutation_description\":\"replace &gt; with &lt; in caret_covers cur_maj&gt;0\",\"why_it_survived\":\"same\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:128:23(&gt;=)\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":128,\"mutation_description\":\"replace &gt; with &gt;= in caret_covers cur_maj&gt;0\",\"why_it_survived\":\"same\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:129:25\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":129,\"mutation_description\":\"replace &amp;&amp; with || in caret_covers major-branch\",\"why_it_survived\":\"no test isolating new_maj mismatch vs new_min mismatch\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:129:20\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":129,\"mutation_description\":\"replace == with != (new_maj check)\",\"why_it_survived\":\"same\"},\n    {\"id\":\"cascade.rs:129:36\",\"file\":\"crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs\",\"line\":129,\"mutation_description\":\"replace == with != (new_min check)\",\"why_i