, plus pre-existing `solve_cascade` regions) — a genuine, long-standing coverage gap predating this track, not introduced by it. Verified non-vacuous: 8 mutants were generated inside the new Fixed-group convergence block (lines 384-434) and all 8 were caught — notably, the exact structural analogues of two of those mutants in the pre-existing Linked-group block (`cascade.rs:333/336`) *did* survive, while the new mirrored guards (`404/407`) did not, meaning the new tests are strictly stronger than the code they were modeled on. (An earlier note in this entry, based on a mid-run snapshot before cargo-mutants finished, mischaracterized this as one in-scope survivor — corrected here.) 25 precision tests targeting the pre-existing survivors were specified by the mutator; deferred as backlog, out of this track's scope."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2036,"cache_read_input_tokens":667343,"output_tokens":1076,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2036,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1076,"cache_read_input_tokens":667343,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2036},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce93LfwztFmErKWuFVTb5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b39b4364-acbb-4975-bb05-24cfafc2d9a7","timestamp":"2026-08-17T21:36:33.381Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
